---

sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Employee
  participant API as RuleAssessmentController
  participant Attempts as RuleAssessmentAttemptService
  participant Catalog as Policy, catalog and mapped bank
  participant PG as Owned paper and command store
  participant Worker as RuleAssessmentOutcomeService
  Employee->>API: Start purpose and exact selection or module context
  API->>Attempts: Trusted actor, retry key and expected context
  Attempts->>PG: Learner lock, replay and resumable-attempt check
  alt New admission
    Attempts->>Catalog: Active scoped policy, readiness and exact completion
    Catalog-->>Attempts: All frozen TARGET or MAIN plus prerequisite groups
    Attempts->>PG: Persist full paper, option order and server deadline
  end
  Attempts-->>Employee: Safe paper without protected answer keys
  Employee->>Attempts: Answer presented item with expected revision
  Attempts->>PG: Before-deadline answer and replay receipt
  alt Explicit submit
    Employee->>Attempts: Submit exact own attempt
  else Deadline reached
    Attempts->>Attempts: expireDue under persisted owner lock
  end
  Attempts->>PG: FINALIZED plus per-group results and outbox
  Note over Attempts,PG: finishReason SUBMITTED or DEADLINE, unanswered equals zero
  PG-->>Worker: Durable finalized event
  Worker->>PG: Idempotent diagnostics or evidence, review and supplementation
  Note over Worker,PG: Waiting for required B is pending work, not scoring failure
